e: i będzie, co krzywe, proste, a ostre drogami równymi: i ujrzy wszelkie ciało zbawienie Boże.","en":"And he came into all the country about the Jordan, preaching the baptism of penance for the remission of sins, as it is written in the book of the sayings of Isaias the prophet: A voice of one crying in the wilderness: Prepare ye the way of the Lord, make straight His paths. Every valley shall be filled, and every mountain and hill shall be brought low: and the crooked shall be made straight, and the rough ways plain: and all flesh shall see the salvation of God."},"tc":{"pl":[299],"en":[300]},"g":{"pl":["i","przyszedł","w","całą","krainę","Jordanu","głosząc","chrzest","pokuty","na","odpuszczenie","grzechów","jak","napisane","jest","w","księdze","mów","Izajasza","proroka","głos","wołającego","na","pustyni","przygotujcie","drogę","Pańską","proste","czyńcie","ścieżki","Jego","wszelka","dolina","będzie napełniona","i","wszelka","góra","i","pagórek","będzie zniżony","i","będą","kręte","w","proste","i","nierówne","w","drogi","równe","i","ujrzy","wszelkie","ciało","zbawienie","Boże"],"en":["and","he came","into","all","the country","of the Jordan","preaching","the baptism","of penance","unto","the remission","of sins","as","written","it is","in","the book","of the sayings","of Isaias","the prophet","a voice","of one crying","in","the desert","prepare ye","the way","of the Lord","straight","make ye","the paths","His","every","valley","shall be filled","and","every","mountain","and","hill","shall be brought low","and","shall be","the crooked","into","straight ways","and","the rough","into","ways","plain","and","shall see","all","flesh","the salvation","of God"]},"fn":{"pl":{"w059":"Tu rzeczownik, księga, a nie przymiotnik pod tym samym hasłem słownikowym.","w064":"Imiesłów w dopełniaczu użyty rzeczownikowo: „tego, który woła”.","w085":"Przymiotniki użyte rzeczownikowo: to, co krzywe, ma stać się prostym."},"en":{"w059":"Here the noun, a book, and not the adjective that shares its spelling.","w064":"A genitive participle used as a noun: “of one who is crying”.","w085":"Adjectives standing as nouns: what is crooked is to become straight."}}}]}